seq v=1 rig=transcript program=claude build=2.1.0
# Twin of a_turn_end_closes_the_turn_and_then_amends_its_numbers (S2, A3):
# the vendor turn's end closes the turn no screen step holds, out=done
# with its rollup; the worst rollup (every counter but lost=) keeps tools=
# on the close, and vdur_ms tok_in tok_out come by an amend after it.
bind 0
see busy
tx prompt v1
expect amend t1 turn vref=v1
pass 10
see prompt bash:not-read-only
pass 10
see busy
tx tool c0
tx result c0
pass 10
see prompt question
pass 10
see busy
tx tool c1
tx result c1 error
pass 10
see wall:overloaded
pass 10
see busy
tx tool c2
tx result c2
pass 10
see wall:unresponsive
pass 10
see busy
tx tool c3
tx result c3
turn-mail
pass 100
tx end
expect close t1 turn out=done steps=8 appr=1 qs=1 walls=1 stalls=1 mail=1 errs=1 tools=shell:4 src=transcript conf=exact
expect amend t1 turn vdur_ms=4200 tok_in=900 tok_out=120
